  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "group": "G02",
      "cut_start": 0.0,
      "cut_end": 6.47115,
      "seconds": 5.856,
      "target": 7,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "这户人家，父母都是牙科医师。屋里，一切整整齐齐。",
      "sha256": "6d0d8394c0307cca368b5329923fca655fefe867eb8aca55c37c56f5cc4ca426",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S04.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "group": "G02",
      "cut_start": 6.47115,
      "cut_end": 12.7603,
      "seconds": 5.52,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "长子读牙科。次子勇贵二十一岁，还在为升学复读。",
      "sha256": "6a5c665eb1056678a7ec2394bd0ecb2d9dbdbcf82f7366cd6eb5ffd4ccbd3b04",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S05.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "group": "G02",
      "cut_start": 12.7603,
      "cut_end": 17.688,
      "seconds": 4.272,
      "target": 5,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "妹妹亚澄二十岁。读短大，也有自己的梦想。",
      "sha256": "d66fa9fe0e802bfe214deb731eeae590cbe581d9fbb5e67d71b24a4469318a75",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S06.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "group": "G03",
      "cut_start": 0.0,
      "cut_end": 5.24375,
      "seconds": 4.68,
      "target": 7,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "那天下午，母亲和长子离开家，准备回福岛过年。",
      "sha256": "c974eb089f17180927c02fe68805e76c5a54c2237d7b1ab2113eb08037816cad",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S07.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "group": "G03",
      "cut_start": 5.24375,
      "cut_end": 10.9557,
      "seconds": 5.088,
      "target": 7,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "父亲随后也出了门。门一关，家里只剩兄妹两人。",
      "sha256": "8c750b997492d9bf844c6f0e7fce02ffc26bc9fc6898c5041f1d92013c279ecc",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S08.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "group": "G03",
      "cut_start": 10.9557,
      "cut_end": 15.288,
      "seconds": 3.624,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "据他后来的供述，争执中，妹妹提到了梦想。",
      "sha256": "755217bb44bafb58a71157916672912313239e7d866189a37f6c20355a628606",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S09.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "group": "G05",
      "cut_start": 0.0,
      "cut_end": 4.433,
      "seconds": 3.816,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "可当时，他没有报警。他选择了隐瞒。",
      "sha256": "083cb37ff86dd33eac030b750516e530eab710b324d74830c7d172149ab85319",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S13.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "group": "G05",
      "cut_start": 4.433,
      "cut_end": 8.710854999999999,
      "seconds": 3.48,
      "target": 5,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "更反常的是，第二天，他还照常出门。",
      "sha256": "795cdb87e533b5fa0d3102b5b4a6232fee9018c001de5598737c576a09260fce",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S14.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "group": "G05",
      "cut_start": 8.710854999999999,
      "cut_end": 13.776,
      "seconds": 4.296,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "十二月三十一日，他收拾行李，准备去补习班集训。",
      "sha256": "a264f6f4603718fd4487a5969ba8aa810e74efb3612a9792e570c45661dcec60",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S15.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "group": "G07",
      "cut_start": 0.0,
      "cut_end": 5.205705,
      "seconds": 4.776,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "一月二日，家人结束返乡行程，回到了东京的家。",
      "sha256": "837846a89c5e5c52815e61cb16a9750d0959a98ff739673b186a715f03e4dd09",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S19.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "group": "G07",
      "cut_start": 5.205705,
      "cut_end": 10.02297,
      "seconds": 4.176,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "可直到三日晚上，母亲才察觉到一股异味。",
      "sha256": "097a51f0dcfd05623f1d5ed7db454f96e79e3a56f889c5b3f17ece7709e418d6",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S20.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "group": "G07",
      "cut_start": 10.02297,
      "cut_end": 13.536,
      "seconds": 2.856,
      "target": 5,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "她走上三楼，停在儿子的房门前。",
      "sha256": "4aed2c500abcbb2e12d4f2a88ca165af2de69b718a21df05e73d754d24f25573",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S21.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "group": "G08",
      "cut_start": 0.0,
      "cut_end": 5.710875,
      "seconds": 5.208,
      "target": 5,
      "atempo_required": 1.0416,
      "text": "真相就此暴露。次日，警方从集训地带走勇贵。",
      "sha256": "53f47538dcbad9158354ebd70fe92eb5334d28a41f400443bcf0453f052dd752",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S22.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "group": "G08",
      "cut_start": 5.710875,
      "cut_end": 10.6432,
      "seconds": 4.56,
      "target": 7,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "他先否认，随后承认杀人。可法庭的争议，才刚刚开始。",
      "sha256": "9b0598394aece2891cabf5eb0830419ff7c957525b268ef790cbf297501dac6a",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S23.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "group": "G08",
      "cut_start": 10.6432,
      "cut_end": 17.424,
      "seconds": 6.48,
      "target": 7,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "法庭争的，不只是他做了什么，还有当时的责任能力。",
      "sha256": "77d7604efd07eb9d41bfb5661527288a1ee48a13981ec35d664b100846851518",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S24.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "group": "G09",
      "cut_start": 0.0,
      "cut_end": 6.60133,
      "seconds": 6.024,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.004,
      "text": "辩方主张，事后是另一个人格控制了他。争议，就在这里。",
      "sha256": "132cda7db63c9bb63b3f7e3a43c6e0bbbd2ef2738cd2e44b8c5ffd66a9dd8ccf",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S25.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "group": "G09",
      "cut_start": 6.60133,
      "cut_end": 13.947099999999999,
      "seconds": 6.552,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0919999999999999,
      "text": "一审七年。杀人有罪，另一项指控因责任能力问题获判无罪。",
      "sha256": "674ed28941a0bc6e4c527cba62ddea11eb66c09c71ece18957ec67f1ce5149d7",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S26.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "group": "G09",
      "cut_start": 13.947099999999999,
      "cut_end": 19.128,
      "seconds": 4.344,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "可二审发现，他在侦查时，能具体讲清经过。",
      "sha256": "0927042690a2234a715b82cedb19582c1ff124e40a0ffb9ee83203e471c0cf93",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S27.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "group": "G10",
      "cut_start": 0.0,
      "cut_end": 6.055065,
      "seconds": 5.448,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "失忆鉴定的前提被推翻。两罪成立，改判十二年。",
      "sha256": "63b4971bb35bd3506928094f4719f6a0bf5f2881b87b832fd9ed9817e1e1cd08",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S28.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "group": "G10",
      "cut_start": 6.055065,
      "cut_end": 12.82075,
      "seconds": 5.928,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "亚澄的人生，不该被缩成一句话。暴力责任属于施暴者。",
      "sha256": "a125d554f09076974874ac7367dbe52baf51ab806b50d8a96ddb12b51d47d878",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S29.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "group": "G10",
      "cut_start": 12.82075,
      "cut_end": 17.976,
      "seconds": 4.368,
      "target": 6,
      "atempo_required": 1.0,
      "text": "一个家，该怎样对待，被认为不成器的孩子？",
      "sha256": "8c37a225d268860abbb36c0d4c8886f26c0110cb027cb6292f223b85069505e6",
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S30.mp3",
      "alignment_review": "pending; candidate boundary may split the wrong sentence"
